{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voodoo Fishin is an online co-op horror game featuring fishing, proximity voice, and scary monsters. You and up to 3 friends can venture into the swamp to find the best fishing spots holding the rarest fish. BEWARE: Die along the way, and you will lose your catch!<br><br><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/cc5b52be6e913bbe420b71ea83ae60b1.webp?t=1761583912\" width=605 height=55 /></span>The demo represents an early look at the core fishing experience, puppet creator, and spooky vibes. The full game will include more monsters, a metagame, and deeper progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/884d4a23d3c5a5f98df715a148816c18.webp?t=1761583912\" width=605 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/24546b559562c114e9012fb68c1681a5.poster.avif?t=1761583912\" width=608 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/24546b559562c114e9012fb68c1681a5.webm?t=1761583912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/24546b559562c114e9012fb68c1681a5.mp4?t=1761583912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your puppet angler and hit the dock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/25e38bd6fffaef0d011b7db99a473b8f.webp?t=1761583912\" width=605 height=55 /></span><span class=\"